OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,6,Fbright with some sunny spells, perhaps
OL,7,Fpatchy rain or showers developing over
OL,8,FLochaber and southern parts of the
OL,9,FGreat Glen in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will push
OL,12,Fnorthwards during the evening, heavy
OL,13,Fat times. Drier and clearer conditions
OL,14,Freturning from the west later in the
OL,15,Fnight along with a scattering of
OL,16,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
