OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FBright spells and showers,
OL,6,Fthe showers heaviest and most frequent
OL,7,Fin the west with the best of any
OL,8,Fsunshine around Inverness and the more
OL,9,Fsheltered east. Breezy, strong coastal
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy
OL,13,Fwith bright spells and showers on
OL,14,FFriday, the showers becoming lighter
OL,15,Fand more scattered on Saturday with
OL,16,Feasing winds. Heavy rain expected on
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
